                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">鹰隼试翼，风尘吸张。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">奇花初胎，矞矞皇皇。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                     </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">——梁启超《少年中国说》</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614083373.jpg"><BR></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>24</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日，我校全体高一新生为期一周的军训正式拉开帷幕。下午</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>15:30</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">，顶着烈日骄阳，军训开营仪式在田径场举行。校党委书记、校长王琛，党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮，党委委员、副校长蒋明，党委委员、副校长俞奇弘，兰溪国防教育基地马队长，体育组组长何隽豪和高一年级长陈丹燕出席本次仪式。基地教官、高一各班班主任、全体体育老师和部分学生家长也到场参加。德育处主任杨佩琼主持仪式。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614091162.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614091154.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614091132.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614091171.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">我们开营啦</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">  </SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614101000.jpg"><BR></SPAN></FONT></P><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">王琛校长首先作动员讲话，他对各位高一学生的到来表示热烈的欢迎和亲切的问候。他表示，军训是学生进入一中校园的第一课，这一课将会对今后三年的高中生活产生潜移默化的影响。因此，他希望同学们可以在军训期间养成三个意识：爱国意识、素质意识和规矩意识。最后他强调全体高一学生要在军训中“自觉磨练、战胜自我，克服高温等不利因素，经受住来自心理、体质等多方面的考验，建立干任何事情都不放弃、不抛弃的强大自信，增强承受困难和挫折的勇气”。他祝愿同学们在军训中练出成绩、练出水平、炼就骨气！最后他预祝本次军训取得圆满成功！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614102404.jpg"><BR> </SPAN></FONT></P><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">国防教育基地马队长首先对学校能够将此次军训重任交到兰溪基地手上表示衷心感谢。他表示，全体军官将不断磨炼意志，吃苦耐劳，认真履行职责，发挥不怕苦不怕累的精神。同时，他也借此向参训学生提出了几点要求：一要端正思想、认真对待，以高标准严格要求自己；二要加强组织纪律观念，服从命令，听从指挥；三要不怕困难，刻苦训练；四要注意保证人身安全。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">学生代表发言</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614105994.jpg"><BR></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">随后，高一（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">）班沈亦知同学作为学生代表发言。她激动地表达了自己进入一中校园的喜悦之情和对未来高中生活的无比期待之感。她表示，对于接下来的军训生活，所有的同学都已做好了吃苦的准备，会为成为共和国新时代的开拓者与守护者不断努力。最后，她慷慨呼喊，这以正步开篇的高中第一步，将见证全体高一学生一步步走向成熟、走向成功。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">授旗仪式</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614113967.jpg"><BR></SPAN></FONT></P><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">王琛校长为高一各班旗手授班旗。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face="Times New Roman">16</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">面班旗迎风飘扬，给全场披上了一片亮彩，相信在每一位同学心里，这是振奋人心的时刻。仪式上，杨佩琼宣读了《绍兴一中学生军训守则》，强调了相关管理纪律。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center></SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> <IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614121332.jpg"><BR></SPAN></FONT></P><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">相信全体高一学生将度过一段充实而富有意义的军训时光，并请共同期待他们在度过为期一周的军训生活后展示出的全新的精神面貌，一定能完美蜕变为更加有热血、更加有担当的一中博雅学子！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=center></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> <IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614124177.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614124169.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614124141.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201908/2019082614124180.jpg"><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
